  "description": "A .NET client library for the Coolify self-hosting platform REST API. Coolify.Net wraps every Coolify resource — servers, projects, applications, databases, one-click services, deployments, teams, private keys, and system status — behind a small, typed, fully async surface so you can provision and manage Coolify infrastructure from C# without hand-writing HTTP calls.",
